    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_TabSetup">Initial setup</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupPageHelp">Run this guided assistant whenever you want to review the basic choices: disconnect protection, overlays and notifications, and quick access. It only changes Controller Manager settings.</sys:String>
