    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_AboutDescription">Controller Manager identifies and tracks controllers actively used during a game session. It provides five core features: adaptive controller switching for local and multiplayer games, gamepad tester, connection notifications, disconnection notifications, and automatic game pausing when a controller disconnects. It is highly customizable, adapting to both desktop and fullscreen modes while supporting battery state displays, custom names, and icons.</sys:String>
